    {
      "id": "2126543662179905586",
      "text": "LA within 1 with 7.7 left after the Reaves 3 (3rd of the 4th Q), a Fox double dribble, and 2 FT's from LaRavia with SAS intentionally fouling to take away a tying-3 attempt. LA will try for a steal or foul right away, but are out of time outs and can't advance the ball...",
      "url": "https://x.com/LakersReporter/status/2126543662179905586",
      "published": "2026-11-28T05:08:12+00:00",
      "likes": 48,
      "author": "Mike Trudell",
      "handle": "LakersReporter",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/524367536763056130/32h6Ng8Y_normal.jpeg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2126543124973678876",
      "text": "Jake LaRavia was indeed fouled.",
      "url": "https://x.com/LakersNation/status/2126543124973678876",
      "published": "2026-11-28T05:06:04+00:00",
      "likes": 77,
      "author": "Lakers Nation",
      "handle": "LakersNation",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1443416270729322500/pfmulT-l_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "Spurs had a foul to give and will take it. Guessing they will try to foul again here up 3.",
      "quoted_author": "Lakers Nation",
      "quoted_handle": "LakersNation"
    },
    {
      "id": "2126542650396315972",
      "text": "Another Reaves 3 cuts the margin in half and the Lakers don't have to foul, down 3 with 32 seconds left.",
      "url": "https://x.com/LakersReporter/status/2126542650396315972",
      "published": "2026-11-28T05:04:11+00:00",
      "likes": 75,
      "author": "Mike Trudell",
