      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2126541797577105587",
      "text": "Tough sequence for LA, with Wemby getting a foul call on a jumper with minimal leg contact from Kessler, and Fox getting around LaRavia for an offensive board on the 2nd FT miss that resulted in a kick-out 3 (Castle's 4th). Lakers go from down 2, to down 6, and 43.4 left.",
      "url": "https://x.com/LakersReporter/status/2126541797577105587",
      "published": "2026-11-28T05:00:48+00:00",
      "likes": 92,
      "author": "Mike Trudell",
