    },
    {
      "id": "2126539117714362615",
      "text": "Two huge 3's from Austin Reaves at 4:28 and 3:17 here as he finds his rhythm after missing 6 games since the heel bruise on Nov. 11. That cuts the SAS lead back to 2 with 3:16 to play.",
      "url": "https://x.com/LakersReporter/status/2126539117714362615",
      "published": "2026-11-28T04:50:09+00:00",
      "likes": 139,
      "author": "Mike Trudell",
